# Scenario 'kbd_abook': address book editing with every keyboard key that the round-1 scenarios never pressed.
# Entry 1 (saved by mail_inbox) is edited: the address keyboard (ASCII, type 9) gets characters, then B (backspace with text), the name keyboard
# (kana, type 8) gets dakuten, handakuten, katakana page, katakana ウ+゛ (ヴ), backspace, and a name longer than the field.
# Then a new entry (slot 2) is created with a 46-character address (three address lines) and an 8-character name and viewed. Keyboard routes are computed by
# tools/trace/kbdnav.py from the ROM's neighbour tables. Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # top menu -> メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x3
wait 30
tap A                        # アドレスちょう
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot view
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_address
# address keyboard (type 9): type two characters, then B deletes with text present (the round-1 runs pressed B on an empty field only)
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap B x3
shot addr_after_bs
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap DOWN
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot name_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot name_kbd
tap DOWN
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
tap LEFT
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
shot name_dakuten
tap B
tap SELECT
wait 30
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap UP
tap UP
tap UP
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap RIGHT
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
shot name_katakana
tap B x2
# fill the field beyond its 8 characters
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap UP
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
shot name_full
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_done
# --- new entry in slot 2: a 46-character address (three address lines) and an 8-character name
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A
wait 60
tap A                        # slot 2 intro
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # address keyboard
waitstable 60 max 600
# OK on the still empty address: dialog $0205 'メールアドレスは からっぽでいけません'
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_ok_empty
tap A                        # dialog OK
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A x46
shot slot2_long_addr
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # name intro -> name keyboard
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap LEFT
tap UP
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # save confirm: はい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_saved
# view entry 2 (long address lines)
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_view
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
